---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { business, mailto, sms } from '../data/business';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms"
  description="Current estimate, scheduling, service-area, surface, and payment information for SELI Wash Co."
>
  <section class="band band-ink page-head">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="eyebrow">Terms</p>
      <h1 class="display">Service information.</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        The practical conditions below apply to estimate requests and concrete
        cleaning work from {business.name}.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="band band-paper">
    <div class="wrap prose">
      <h2 class="sec-h">Estimates and prices</h2>
      <p>
        Estimates are free. Listed prices are starting points for ordinary,
        accessible work and are not final quotes. Size, buildup, staining,
        access, surface condition, treatment, and travel can change the price.
        You receive the final quote before work begins.
      </p>
      <p>
        Standalone appointments have a ${business.pricing.standaloneMinimum}
        minimum. Steps are $10 each when added to another service during the
        same visit.
      </p>

      <h2 class="sec-h">Service area and travel</h2>
      <p>
        Service is based in {business.area.label}. Work outside Duncan is
        considered by request. Travel is ${business.area.travelChargePerMile}
        per additional mile and is included in the quote before approval.
      </p>

      <h2 class="sec-h">Making a request</h2>
      <p>
        The estimate form checks your answers in your browser and prepares a text
        message for you to review. Your request reaches {business.name} only when
        you send that message from your own messaging app, or when you call or
        email us directly. Preparing a message does not place a request.
      </p>
      <p>
        Photos are attached in your messaging app; this website does not upload
        them.
      </p>

      <h2 class="sec-h">Scheduling</h2>
      <p>
        Estimate requests do not reserve a time. Every request, price, and work
        day is confirmed directly. Regular work days are Tuesday and Thursday,
        9am to 6pm; weekend work may be considered by request.
      </p>

      <h2 class="sec-h">What the property provides</h2>
      <p>
        Work requires an accessible outdoor water spigot and working outdoor
        GFCI-protected outlet, with the cleaning area within about{' '}
        {business.equipment.hoseFeet} feet of both.
      </p>

      <h2 class="sec-h">Surfaces and results</h2>
      <p>
        Service is limited to ordinary concrete flatwork. Decorative, painted,
        coated, sealed, stamped, or otherwise fragile surfaces may be declined.
        Unusual surfaces are assessed before work begins.
      </p>
      <p>
        Oil, rust, paint, gum, and deeply embedded stains may not come out, and
        some staining is permanent. Expected results are discussed before the
        job starts.
      </p>

      <h2 class="sec-h">Payment</h2>
      <p>Accepted payment methods: {business.payments.join(', ')}.</p>

      <h2 class="sec-h">Questions</h2>
      <p>
        Text {business.phone.display} or email{' '}
        <a class="inline-link" href={mailto}>{business.email}</a>.
      </p>

      <p class="actions legal-actions">
        <a class="btn btn-outline" href={sms}>Text {business.phone.display}</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .page-head .eyebrow { color: var(--amber); }
  .page-head h1 {
    margin-block: 0.7rem 1rem;
    color: var(--paper);
    font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 5vw, var(--s8));
  }
  .page-head .lede { color: var(--slate-ltr); }
  .sec-h {
    margin-top: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    color: var(--ink);
    font-family: var(--display);
    font-size: var(--s5);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .sec-h:first-of-type { margin-top: 0; }
  .inline-link { color: var(--amber-deep); font-weight: 600; }
  .legal-actions { margin-top: 2rem; }
</style>
